# 9. RENT GENERATION ENGINE

Create centralized recurring rent generation logic.

Use lease ID and billing period to identify a unique rent charge.

Example idempotency identity:

leaseId + billingPeriod + chargeType

Prevent duplicate rent invoices if Generate Rent is clicked multiple times.

Support:

- Monthly rent
- Partial payment
- Full payment
- Credits
- Due dates
- Overdue status
- Payment reversal
- Lease start/end boundaries

If partial-month proration is enabled, document the formula clearly.

Do not silently assume all leases require the same prorating method.

Because there is no backend scheduler, due charges must be generated by an explicit local action or an idempotent application-opening reconciliation workflow.

Do not claim automatic generation while the browser is closed.

